        <activityName xml:lang="en">Treatment, particle board production effluent, to wastewater treatment, class 3</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Treatment, particle board production effluent, to wastewater treatment, class 3
Wastewater purified in a medium size municipal wastewater treatment plant (capacity class 3), with an average capacity size of 24900 per-captia-equivalents PCE. \nWastewater contains (in kg/m3): BOD: 0.196 (GSD=140.4%);
UUID: 493f3900-2a4b-4e7c-ace9-19e4749a81db
Infrastructure materials for municipal wastewater treatment plant, transports, dismantling. Land use burdens.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Three stage wastewater treatment (mechanical, biological, chemical) including sludge digestion (fermentation) according to the average technology in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_493f3900-2a4b-4e7c-ace9-19e4749a81db.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
